{
  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 2, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.8, "A": 0.8, "C": 0.6, "V": 0.9},
  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据片段：'required changes' 和 'current systems'。解释：这些术语不具体，读者无法准确理解什么变化和哪些系统，降低可理解性。",
    "A": "证据片段：'in a timely manner'。解释：这个短语主观且未定义时间范围，导致歧义，不同利益相关者可能有不同解释。",
    "C": "证据片段：整体句子逻辑依赖 'cannot be completed in a timely manner'。解释：条件未明确定义，可能影响逻辑正确性，但假设变化无法完成则在新应用实现，基本合理。",
    "V": "证据片段：'cannot be completed in a timely manner'。解释：条件模糊，无法设计测试用例来验证是否满足，缺乏可测试性。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "改写需求以明确术语：'If the changes specified in requirement set RS-001 cannot be implemented in the legacy systems SystemA and SystemB within a defined timeframe, then the WUT System must implement them in the new application AppX.'",
    "A": "替换 'in a timely manner' 为具体时间，如 'within 30 calendar days from the start date'。",
    "C": "定义 'timely manner' 为具体标准，如 'within the project timeline of 30 days'，以确保正确性。",
    "V": "使条件可测量：'If implementation is not completed by the deadline date 2023-12-31.'"
  },
  "issues": [
    {
      "type": "U",
      "evidence": "required changes cannot be completed to the current systems",
      "rewrite": "the specific changes listed in change log CL-001 cannot be implemented in the legacy systems SystemX and SystemY"
    },
    {
      "type": "A",
      "evidence": "in a timely manner",
      "rewrite": "within 30 calendar days from request approval"
    },
    {
      "type": "C",
      "evidence": "if the required changes cannot be completed to the current systems in a timely manner",
      "rewrite": "if the implementation of specified changes is not feasible in the legacy systems within the agreed timeframe of 30 days"
    },
    {
      "type": "V",
      "evidence": "cannot be completed in a timely manner",
      "rewrite": "is not completed by the deadline date 2023-12-31"
    }
  ]
}

{
  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 2, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.9, "A": 0.95, "C": 0.8, "V": 0.95},
  "rationales": {"U":"'However, if the required changes cannot be completed to the current systems in a timely manner' contains vague temporal qualifier 'timely manner' and undefined scope 'required changes' — reader cannot determine what changes are implied or what constitutes timeliness without external context.","A":"'the WUT System will need to implement these requirements within the new application' is ambiguous: 'these requirements' lacks antecedent (no prior requirements are stated in R1); 'new application' is undefined (version? replacement system? module?) — multiple interpretations possible.","C":"The statement is logically plausible as a contingency plan but lacks falsifiability and traceability; no violation of domain facts is evident, though correctness depends on unstated assumptions about system boundaries — hence score 3.","V":"No testable condition or observable outcome is specified: 'will need to implement' is normative and non-observable; no success criterion (e.g., 'within 5 business days', 'with 100% functional coverage') is provided — cannot design a pass/fail test case."},
  "suggestions": {"U":"Replace with atomic, self-contained statement specifying trigger condition, subject, and action using defined terms.","A":"Define 'required changes' by referencing a controlled requirements identifier (e.g., REQ-001–REQ-005); define 'new application' as 'WUT v2.0, released Q3 2025'.","C":"Keep unchanged — no factual error detected, but correctness hinges on upstream requirement definition.","V":"Rewrite to specify measurable trigger (e.g., 'if change implementation exceeds 10 person-days in legacy WUT v1.x') and verifiable outcome (e.g., 'then WUT v2.0 SHALL include all functionality described in REQ-001 through REQ-005 by 2025-09-30')."},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"if the required changes cannot be completed to the current systems in a timely manner","rewrite":"if implementation of REQ-001 through REQ-005 in WUT v1.x exceeds 10 person-days of effort"},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"the WUT System will need to implement these requirements within the new application","rewrite":"WUT v2.0 SHALL implement REQ-001 through REQ-005 no later than 2025-09-30"},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"the WUT System will need to implement these requirements within the new application","rewrite":"WUT v2.0 SHALL implement REQ-001 through REQ-005 no later than 2025-09-30, verified by test case TC-REQ-001-005-PASS executing against build WUTv2.0-RC3"}
  ]
}
